        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>12 Inch Contemporary Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12\" contemporary ladder style pull is perfect for smaller doors such as pantry doors, large cabinets and interior doors. It is available in  brushed nickel, polished chrome and oil rubbed bronze finishes to fit any decor; but it is the sharp, clean lines of this door handle that give it a contemporary feel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary door handle is made out of <b>3/4\" diameter (the same diameter as a US penny)</b> tubing. It has a 8\" center to center mounting (distance between the 2 mounting screws). For use on doors made of wood, metal or composites (such as fiberglass). \r\n<br>\r\nFor glass doors use <a href=\"/products/12-inch-glass-door-ladder-pull-pair-sdh-208h\"><b>12 Inch Contemporary Glass Door Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-43-specifications.gif?v=1704354682\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"12 Inch Contemporary Door Pull  Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:  <a href=\"/products/10-inch-contemporary-pull\"><b>10 Inch Contemporary Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/30-inch-round-ladder-pull-sgs-h3000\"><b>30 Inch Contemporary Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/36-inch-ladder-door-pull-with-24-inch-center-to-centers-sgs-h3600\"><b>36 Inch Contemporary Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the 12\" Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\" (305 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 8\" Center to Center (203 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" (19 mm) Round Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Point Diameter: 5/6\" (16 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
