                "title": "12 Inch Contemporary Pull",
                "description": "The 12 inch contemporary ladder style pull is perfect for smaller doors such as pantry doors, large cabinets and interior doors. It is available in  brushed nickel, polished chrome and oil rubbed bronze finishes to fit any decor; but it is the sharp, clean lines of this handle that give it a contemporary feel.",
